{"articleNo":"248529","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=248529&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] (OWHC-AP) 세계유산도시기구 아태지역사무처 콘텐츠 크리에이터 13기 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.02.02","hit":"6775","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0pt; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 160%; text-indent: 0pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">유네스코 세계유산협약의 이념을 충실히 수행하고 세계유산 보호</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">활용을 위한 세계유산도시들의 다리역할을 수행하고 있는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">OWHC-AP</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">에서는 세계유산도시를 널리 알리고 세계유산도시기구의 홍보에 앞장설 세계유산</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">도시재생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">홍보</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">콘텐츠 제작</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">소셜미디어 마케팅 등에 관심이 있는 국내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">외 대학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">생들을 모집하오니 많은 참여바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">.</span></p><p \"바탕글\";=\"\" 0.0pt;=\"\" 0.0pt=\"\" none;=\"\" 100%;=\"\" keep-all;=\"\" both;=\"\" baseline;=\"\" 10pt;=\"\" 0pt;=\"\" 160%;=\"\" 0);=\"\" 0,=\"\" rgb(0,=\"\" center;=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> &nbsp; </span></p><p \"바탕글\";=\"\" 0.0pt;=\"\" 0.0pt=\"\" none;=\"\" 100%;=\"\" keep-all;=\"\" both;=\"\" baseline;=\"\" 10pt;=\"\" 0pt;=\"\" 160%;=\"\" 0);=\"\" 0,=\"\" rgb(0,=\"\" center;=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> &nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 160%; text-indent: 0pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>1.</strong></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">선발대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">세계유산에 관심 있는 대한민국 청년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">15</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">명 내외</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 160%; text-indent: 0pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 160%; text-indent: 0pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>2.</strong></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">지원자격</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">:</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 160%; text-indent: 0pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">세계유산</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">세계유산도시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">그리고 콘텐츠 제작에 열정과 관심 있는 분</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 160%; text-indent: 0pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">콘텐츠 제작 및 미션 등에 적극적으로 참여하고 활동할 수 있는 분</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 160%; text-indent: 0pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">블로그 및 페이스북</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">인스타그램 등 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">SNS</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">를 활발히 사용하시는 분</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 160%; text-indent: 0pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">세계유산과 세계유산도시를 둘러싼 이야기를 색다르게 풀어내고 싶은 분</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 160%; text-indent: 0pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 160%; text-indent: 0pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>3.</strong></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">우대사항</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 160%; text-indent: 0pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">사진</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">․</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">동영상 촬영 및 편집에 능숙한 분 우대</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 160%; text-indent: 0pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">영어능통자 우대</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 160%; text-indent: 0pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">문화유산 관련 전공 및 신문</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">방송</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">광고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">홍보학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">디자인 등 전공자 우대</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 160%; text-indent: 0pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 160%; text-indent: 0pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>4.</strong></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">활동내용</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 160%; text-indent: 0pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">월</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">회 세계유산</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">세계유산도시 및 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">OWHC-AP </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">관련 홍보기획 제안 및 오프라인 회의를 통한 홍보 트렌드 발표 진행</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 160%; text-indent: 0pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">세계유산 및 세계유산도시 관련 뉴스 및 최신 학술자료 수집 및 관련 콘텐츠 기획 및 제작</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 160%; text-indent: 0pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">OWHC-AP </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso